00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:08.070
When we think of Angels the images conjured
are often quite similar, radiant winged figures

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.550
that have many human traits.

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:17.750
We see this in classical art and modern depictions
so one would assume this is how Angels were

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:23.920
portrayed in biblical and ancient texts but
that is far from the truth.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:30.090
Angels take more a spiritual form as opposed
to a physical one, there is no real description

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:36.980
of what an Angel’s true form is but there
are some descriptions of the bodies they assume.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:45.850
And they are very strange so let's take a
look at some of the different types of angels.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:52.700
In the 12th century scholars divided the angels
around God into categories based on a hierarchical

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:53.729
system.

00:01:53.729 --> 00:02:00.549
In Christianity this is referred to as the
three spheres and the nine orders of angels

00:02:00.549 --> 00:02:05.850
because it describes a three tier system with
three types of angel in each tier but that’s

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.440
Near the bottom of this Hierarchy are the
Cherubim.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:16.410
The book of Ezekiel describes them as having
four faces each one representing something

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:26.230
different, the lion represented wild animals,
the ox domesticated animals, \the eagle represented

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:31.370
birds and the human represented humanity.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:37.170
The cherubim had long straight legs with hooves
and two pairs of wings.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:42.120
You may also see them with regular feet and
four pairs of wings.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:47.440
A much different appearance to the young plump
cherubs we would associate with figures like

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:53.360
Cupid that stem from Christian scholars such
as Thomas Aquinas who characterised them as

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.030
having a burning love for God.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:02.680
The Hebrew bible mentions the word Cherubim
almost one hundred times but their purpose

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:05.380
is still fairly ambiguous.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:11.550
The general belief is that they exist to guard
the garden of Eden, especially the tree of

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:12.780
life.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:19.060
The cherubim having numerous faces has this
almost Chimera feel but the human face is

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:22.069
something more akin to a Sphynx.

00:03:22.069 --> 00:03:34.300
The Seraphim are a type of angel that appear
in Christianity, Judaism and Islam but there

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.740
importance varies.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:42.379
In Judaism they are middle of the road but
in Christianity they assume the highest rank

00:03:42.379 --> 00:03:44.990
possible just under god.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:51.810
The book of Isiah describes them as having
six wings, “Above it stood the seraphim's:

00:03:51.810 --> 00:04:00.530
each one had six wings; with twain he covered
his face, and with twain he covered his feet,

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.890
and with twain he did fly.”

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:11.519
“And one cried unto another, and said, Holy,
holy, holy, is the LORD of hosts: the whole

00:04:11.519 --> 00:04:14.489
earth is full of his glory.”

00:04:14.489 --> 00:04:19.509
From this passage we can gather that two of
these six wings were used to cover their faces,

00:04:19.509 --> 00:04:24.839
two to cover their feet and the last two they
used to fly.

00:04:24.839 --> 00:04:30.240
The second passage describes them almost as
cheerleaders who fly around the throne of

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.710
God spreading word of his glory.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:38.110
This description is not as detailed as the
Cherubim so all we know for sure is that the

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:45.419
Seraphim were made up mostly of wings, the
book of Revelation only differs slightly describing

00:04:45.419 --> 00:04:48.729
their six wings as being full of eyes.

00:04:48.729 --> 00:04:56.599
Is Islam the the term Seraph is used to describe
certain Archangels who born from celestial

00:04:56.599 --> 00:04:59.520
fire.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:05.620
Next we have the Thrones or the Ophanim, these
are about as far from a traditional looking

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:08.159
angel as one can get.

00:05:08.159 --> 00:05:14.639
In Christianity the Ophanim were entities
that acted as chariots or transportation for

00:05:14.639 --> 00:05:16.389
the Cherubim.

00:05:16.389 --> 00:05:22.569
They were giant interlocking wheels with wings
and eyes that would reside in the part of

00:05:22.569 --> 00:05:26.810
the cosmos where material form began to shape.

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:31.250
Like the Seraphim they also chant God's glory
whenever in his presence.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.909
In Hebrew Ophanim refers to wheels of spheres.

00:05:32.909 --> 00:05:39.240
The book of Enoch describes them as the many
eyed ones and places them in the same category

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:43.889
of celestial being as Cherubim and Seraphim.

00:05:43.889 --> 00:05:50.050
Their role here was much more than transportation,
the Ophanim never sleep and forever guard

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:52.270
the throne of God.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:58.439
When Ezekiel has his vision of the great chariot
he describes all three of these angels as

00:05:58.439 --> 00:06:04.169
the guardians but given the strange nature
of what he’s describing some believe this

00:06:04.169 --> 00:06:10.619
was a hallucination others take this Ezekiel's
account as an encounter with UFOs.

00:06:10.619 --> 00:06:17.399
So no one really knows where they came from
and why they look so strange.

00:06:17.399 --> 00:06:23.869
The Virtues are a group of angels who don’t
possess a physical body but have control over

00:06:23.869 --> 00:06:29.889
the elements, they are referred to as the
shining ones because they appear as sparks

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:30.889
of light.

00:06:30.889 --> 00:06:37.520
Their main role was to perform miracles for
those who were deemed as deserving, they would

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:43.629
be given orders from the angels above them
and travel to Earth to perform these miracles.

00:06:43.629 --> 00:06:47.689
On earth they take a human form.

00:06:47.689 --> 00:06:53.129
There are several types of angels along with
the Virtues whose primary form resembles a

00:06:53.129 --> 00:06:57.059
source of light.

00:06:57.059 --> 00:07:03.509
Angels are celestial beings, they are neither
male nor female and essentially they can take

00:07:03.509 --> 00:07:06.110
whatever form they desire.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:11.819
Is it a surprise that the Angels who spend
all their time in the cosmos with God are

00:07:11.819 --> 00:07:16.280
the strangest and most unorthodox looking?

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:23.009
No not really, if you’re talking about regions
that are suppose to be outside of our comprehension

00:07:23.009 --> 00:07:29.089
then surely the beings who inhabit them would
also look out of place even if that does mean

00:07:29.089 --> 00:07:35.119
they resemble something you expect to see
in a Lovecraftian horror or perhaps the writings

00:07:35.119 --> 00:07:38.330
of someone coming down off an acid trip.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:43.849
It also makes sense for the Archangels and
regular angels to be seen in a much more human

00:07:43.849 --> 00:07:48.460
light as they have the most human interaction.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:54.590
The further back you delve into various religious
texts the stranger angels appear to be, as

00:07:54.590 --> 00:08:00.780
later books were added and revised the more
human angels became the norm and maybe this

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:07.810
was done to make things easier to understand,
in reality we may never know but it is still

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:11.729
interesting to examine.

